The '''Carpentry Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Crafts wooden weapons (bows, spears), arrows, and wooden building parts.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.CarpentryWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Carpentry</code>.

